      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Secure the transport of goods with the detection of the opening of truck doors&nbsp;. To combat theft and aggression, thanks to Jaxicloud Fleet Management Innovation’s magnetic Bluetooth sensors, the driver is alerted in real time on his smartphone when the door is opened in an unauthorized area.&nbsp;Find out how and why Jaxicloud Fleet Management Innovations magnetic Bluetooth sensors help secure transportation against theft.</span></p>",
